{
  "slug": "ui5-modernization",
  "name": "Ui5 Modernization",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Complete UI5 modernization toolkit with workflow and specialized fix patterns for modernizing SAPUI5/OpenUI5 applications.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **19 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (19): `fix-bootstrap-params` (Fix HTML bootstrap parameter issues that UI5 linter reports but cannot auto-fix), `fix-component-async` (Fix Component.js async configuration issues that UI5 linter reports but cannot auto-fix), `fix-control-renderer` (Fix Control renderer issues that UI5 linter reports but cannot auto-fix), `fix-csp-compliance` (Fix Content Security Policy (CSP) compliance issues that UI5 linter reports but cannot auto-fix), `fix-cyclic-deps` (Detect and resolve cyclic module dependencies introduced during UI5 modernization), `fix-deprecated-controls` (Fix deprecated control/class/interface/type issues that UI5 linter reports but cannot auto-fix), `fix-fiori-elements-extensions` (Handle Fiori Elements V2 controller extensions during UI5 modernization), `fix-js-globals` (Fix JavaScript `no-globals` errors that UI5 linter reports but cannot auto-fix), and 11 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `chrome-devtools`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install ui5-modernization@claude-plugins-official` from `UI5/plugins-coding-agents` (`plugins/ui5-modernization`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 19,
    "mcp": 1
  },
